{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02768","headline":"奉使益州至长安发锺阳驿 · 卢照邻","name":"奉使益州至长安发锺阳驿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"跻险方未夷，乘春聊骋望。\n落花赴丹谷，奔流下青嶂。\n葳蕤晓树滋，滉瀁春江涨。\n平川看钓侣，狭径闻樵唱。\n蝶戏绿苔前，莺歌白云上。\n耳目多异赏，风烟有奇状。\n峻阻将长城，高标吞巨舫。\n联翩事羁靮，辛苦劳疲恙。\n夕济几潺湲，晨登每惆怅。\n谁念复刍狗，山河独偏丧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}